# Deny by default. This is the public tool repository: it holds code and
# documentation only. Real session payloads live in the private Vault and are
# never committable here.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!LICENSE
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!*.cmd
!*.ps1
!*.psd1
!Agents/
!Agents/*.psd1
!ACTIVE_HOST.txt
!Launchers/
!Launchers/**
Launchers/Shortcuts/*.lnk
!examples/
!examples/**

# Session payload paths are not allowed in this repository. The allowances for
# Claude/ and Codex/ session trees belong in the private Vault only.

# Machine-local configuration must never be committed.
AgentSessionSync.config.psd1

# Explicit credential and local database blocks.
auth.json
config.toml
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.env
